  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Support - Transition to a Regional Circular Economy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this engagement is to designate funds for program support costs within the project framework. These program support costs are intended to bolster all engagements encompassed by the program, including capacity building, seminars, and conferences, fostering synergy and alignment among the three engagements. Additionally, the allocated funds are meant to cover expenses related to hosting the project steering committee, monitoring, reviewing, evaluation, and consultancy costs for technical support. It should be noted that this list serves as illustrative examples and may incorporate additional activities as deemed necessary.</narrative>
  </description>
